msgctxt "#30016"
msgid "Choose the BIOS image to use. The official BIOS must be provided by the user. Using a non-official (or builtin) BIOS might result in incompatibility problems with some games. Best results are to be achieved with the official Nintendo BIOS."
msgstr ""

